1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Star-Map Memory-Wall, desperate.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,300
Lyra: Hold! Don't crumble!

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,600
Echo Shard: Unnecessary struggle. Release.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,900
Lyra: My map! My path!

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,200
Kael: The fall... it waits.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,500
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Precarious Ledge of the Star-Map, urgent.

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,800
Lyra: Get back!

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,100
Echo Shard: A futile gesture.

9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,400
Lyra: No choice. Take this!

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,700
Kael: The cost... always.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
♪ at dawn, in Fragmented Star-Map Outcrop, tense.

12
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Lyra: Damage report. Where am I?

13
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,600
Kael: Points of light... fading.

14
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,900
Lyra: Too many gaps. I can't navigate.

15
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,200
Lyra: The Silence... it's thorough.

16
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,500
♪ in broad daylight, in Labyrinth of Forgotten Navigation Consoles, dread.

17
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,800
Lyra: New path. Must be a way through.

18
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,100
Loom of Oblivion: We gather. We preserve.

19
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,400
Lyra: No. Not 'preserve'. Devour.

20
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:52,700
Kael: The weaving... it begins.

21
00:00:53,1000 --> 00:00:56,1000
♪ in broad daylight, in Collapsed Console Chamber, desperate.

22
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,300
Lyra: Trapped! No, no, no!

23
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,600
Loom of Oblivion: This data... returns to us.

24
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,900
Lyra: My coordinates! Gone!

25
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,200
Kael: The cold embrace... again.

26
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,500
♪ at dusk, in Narrow Memory-Corridor, tense.

27
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,800
Lyra: Not Kael's shard. Not yet.

28
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:12,100
Loom of Oblivion: Resistance is... inefficient.

29
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,400
Lyra: Think! Another way!

30
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,700
Kael: My strength... it fades.

31
00:01:16,1000 --> 00:01:19,1000
♪ at dusk, in Debris-Strewn Memory Junction, urgent.

32
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:22,300
Lyra: This will have to do!

33
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,600
Loom of Oblivion: Insignificant... data.

34
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:24,900
Lyra: Go! Now!

35
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,200
Kael: A small price...

36
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:32,500
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Edge of the Devoured Star-Map, dread.

37
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,800
Lyra: No! My map! Stop!

38
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:37,100
Loom of Oblivion: Returning... to the source.

39
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,400
Lyra: Lost. Completely lost.

40
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:39,700
Kael: The path... erased.

41
00:01:40,1000 --> 00:01:44,1000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Fragmented Memory-Space Nexus, desperate.

42
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:46,300
Lyra: A compass. Anything!

43
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,600
Kael: Look inward... the first journey.

44
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,900
Lyra: My first flight? A child's dream?

45
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,200
Lyra: Yes! That way!

46
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:57,500
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Core Identity Shard, dread.

47
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,800
Lyra: My name. My home.

48
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,100
Loom of Oblivion: The core... ours.

49
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,400
Lyra: No! Mine!

50
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:03,700
Kael: It sees... everything.

51
00:02:04,1000 --> 00:02:08,1000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Threshold of Oblivion, shattered.

52
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:10,300
Lyra: Kael... or me.

53
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,600
Loom of Oblivion: One will be lost. Choose.

54
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:13,900
Kael: Live... Lyra. Remember.

55
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,200
Lyra: I can't... I can't!
